01. Add the Console function. After clicking "Application" to generate the configuration file in the "Game Settings" interface, close the game and enter the Game Installation Directory\HYZJ_Data\Config folder. Open the "Game Setting" file and change "DEBUGMODE=0" to "DEBUGMODE=1", then restart the game and use "F4" to open or close the Console. We are sorry for the console only has a Chinese interface. If you use the console to jump the scene at will, it may lead to errors in task logic. Please use it carefully!!!

02. Fixed the bug that some enemies could not cause critical damage when they were attacked in battle;

03. Fixed the bug that NPC would deduct money repeatedly in the "Reunion" task in Tanzhou;

04. Modify the description content of some texts in the game in order to keep in line with the world outlook of the follow-up works;

05. We apply 32 Bit version and you can press "LIBRARY"-"GAMES"-"Properties"-"BETAS" then choose "hongyuan(x86)" to download it;

Any questions or complaints please [u]hoogyuan@gmail.com[/u]

1.Adding voice narration of begin video;

2.Cancellation function added for "Esc";

3.Adding the function of displaying enemy name, action state and buff state when choosing a single enemy attack in battle;

4.Add the button for back to the begin menu and exit the game in the main menu - options page, remove the function of the "Tab";

5.Wind Splitting of Jiangyuan's skill changed from single to AOE, improve the skill power of Sword Spirit;

6.The businessman of Manor will appear follow the Market's LV;

7.Kuafu appears after the Collection task is opened, but it will not disappear as long as it is not defeated.

