01. Add new system - TAME THE MONSTERS. Most of the monsters in the game can be tamed, and tamed monsters can be used as the guard to add attributes for the role. The guard will also have a chance to fight and unleash skills at the same time as the role is attacking. Tame the monster need to buy special props, "Tame Token" and use it in battle to wounded monster;

